2046	2160	2043	2043	She	106	“ That ’s what I ’ll do after college ! I ’ll get my hands on one of these prairie towns and make it beautiful . Be an inspiration . I suppose I ’d better become a teacher then , but -- I wo n’t be that kind of a teacher . I wo n’t drone . Why should they have all the garden suburbs on Long Island ? Nobody has done anything with the ugly towns here in the Northwest except hold revivals and build libraries to contain the Elsie books . I ’ll make ‘ em put in a village green , and darling cottages , and a quaint Main Street ! ”
